</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Prove the monotone convergence theorem for real sequences using completeness.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Study the Bolzano--Weierstrass theorem for bounded sequences.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
