<p>
<md>\lim_{x\to0}
\frac{\sin x}{x}=1</md>
</p>

<p>geometrically.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Derive</p>

<p>
<md>\lim_{x\to0}
\frac{1-\cos x}{x^2}
=
\frac12</md>
</p>

<p>from the sine limit.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Prove</p>

<p>
<md>\lim_{x\to\infty}
\frac{x^n}{e^x}
=
0</md>
</p>

<p>for positive integer <m>n</m>.</p>
